 You have 5 options available.

 Option 1 is to find a nymph and let her steal them from you.

 Option 2 is to find a fountain upstairs. When you float over the fountain
you will gently float to the ground. By dipping your boots into the fountain
there is a possibility that they will have their curse removed.

 Option 3 is to find a magic trap and keep floating over it until you get
the message that it feels like someone is helping you.

 Option 4 is to zap a wand of cancellation at yourself. (But all your other
things will lose their encantment and and your wands will become uncharged
and you scrolls will become blank so drop the things you want charges kept
on first.

 Option 5 is to find a sink and float over it. You will now land with a clunk.
Then drink from the sink until it becomes a fountain. I would only do this
as a last resort however because drinking from sinks can be risky :-).

Hope this helps.

